LINE: '-   A few days before the start of training, confirm site availability and contact trainees to remind them of the training dates, times, and location.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   At the end of training, provide an assignment to, and schedule regular meetings with, each of your team members.' -> H1=False
