LINE: 'Many of the items needed to conduct and participate in training have been bundled into kits. The kits needed during Field Representative (FR) training are listed in this section.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'Upon receiving the kits, verify you have enough for your training session. Open one kit of each type and verify the contents. If you did not receive enough kits, the kits are missing any materials, or there are incorrect quantities of any material, notify your manager immediately.' -> H1=False
