COMMITTED: order=90, title='Step 4: Record Each Assignment on Form SC-20, Field Supervisor's Management Record', content_len=646
NEW_TITLE: 'Step 5: Report the Assignment on Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'For tracking purposes, all assignments you make must be reported to the SCO.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In the heading of the Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet, enter your SCID, FSA number, and the date in the spaces provided.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   On the first row of the form:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (1), enter the number of the AA being assigned.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Leave Column (2) blank.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (3), enter your name, as the person previously assigned the AA.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Columns (4) and (5), enter the name and employee ID number of the trainee receiving the assignment.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Use the next available row on the form to enter the information above for the second assignment for the Field Exercise. Continue this process until all assignments for the Field Exercise are listed on the form.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Complete the **Page \_\_\_ of \_\_\_ pages** item in the form header.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Provide the completed form to your manager.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
