NEW_TITLE: 'Step 5: Report the Assignment on Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'For tracking purposes, all assignments you make must be reported to the SCO on a Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet. Each day that you make assignments you will complete one Reassignment Worksheet, listing all assignments made that day.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In the heading of the form, enter your SCID, FSA number, and the date in the spaces provided.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   On the first available row of the form:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (1), enter the number of the AA being assigned.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Leave Column (2) blank.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (3), enter the person previously assigned the AA. In most cases, this will be your name.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Columns (4) and (5), enter the name and employee ID number of the team member who received the assignment.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If making another assignment this same day, use the next available row on the form to enter the information above for that assignment. Continue this process until all assignments made this day are listed on the form. If necessary, use an additional Form 336.1, Reassignment Worksheet' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   After listing all assignment made this day, complete the **Page\_\_\_\_ of \_\_\_\_\_ pages** item in the form header.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Provide the completed form to your manager at your next meeting.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'See Figure 5. Example of Form 336.1, Reassignment Worksheet. on page [59](#_Ref140830354).' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# Providing the Assignment to the Team Member' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=98, title='Step 5: Report the Assignment on Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet', content_len=1317
NEW_TITLE: 'Providing the Assignment to the Team Member'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'After making and recording the assignment, provide the assignment package (Address Register and questionnaire envelope(s)) to the team member.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Have the team member review the maps in the map envelope. Make sure they know where the AA is located and how to get to it. If you have any notes about the area, from your review of your FSA prior to conducting FR training, discuss them with the team member.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Have the team member review the Form SC-920, Address List Page. If there are any addresses with an entry of PC in Column (3), Special Situations, make sure the team member understands they are to proceed with caution. This means they are to work the address as usual but be aware that the residents may not want them on their property.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If they feel unsafe approaching the property, or are asked to leave the property, they should try to locate and work the address with a proxy respondent, if possible. If they cannot safely work the address, they should follow procedures for Dangerous Area/Address or Threatening Situation.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'In addition to the assignment package, there are other materials team members need to successfully complete their work. Supplies of these items were provided at the end of their training. After providing an assignment, verify the team member has an adequate supply of the materials listed below. If they need additional quantities of an item, provide them from the office bulk supply kit in the SCO.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Unlabeled Forms SC-Q, Special Census Questionnaire' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-CQ, Special Census Continuation Questionnaire' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-921, Add Page' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-225, INFO-COMM' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-CN(E/S), Confidentiality Notice' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-ID, Language Identification Card' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-IS, Information Sheet' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-NV(E/S), Notice of Visit' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms BC-27, Time, Attendance, and Cost Report' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms BC-27A, Field Employee\'s Reimbursement Expenses' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'For any team member speaking fluent Spanish:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-Q(S), Special Census Questionnaires (Spanish)' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-CQ(S), Special Census Continuation Questionnaires (Spanish)' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Forms SC-IS(S), Information Sheet (Spanish)' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# A Team Member Refuses an Assignment' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=99, title='Providing the Assignment to the Team Member', content_len=2125
NEW_TITLE: 'A Team Member Refuses an Assignment'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'If a team member refuses to accept an assignment, ask the reason why and then contact your manager for guidance.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'Do not force the assignment on the team member or threaten them with termination.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'Do not provide the team member another assignment package or give this assignment package to another team member until you have discussed the situation with your manager.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# Moving an Assignment from One Team Member to Another' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=100, title='A Team Member Refuses an Assignment', content_len=367
NEW_TITLE: 'Moving an Assignment from One Team Member to Another'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'During the Special Census, you may need to move an assignment from one team member to another team member for completion. This is most often done:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   When a team member quits the job' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   When a team member is let go due to performance or conduct issues' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   When a team member has outstanding interviews needing conducted by another team member. These are usually due to respondent refusals or language issues.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'When an assignment needs to be moved to a different team member for completion, be sure to gather from the original team member the assignment package -- the Address Register (including all maps) and the questionnaire envelope (containing all remaining labeled Forms SC-Q, Special Census Questionnaires). These materials will be provided to the new team member for completion.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'After gathering the assignment package, in Section 1, Assignment Information, on the Form SC-940, Address Register Cover Page (located in the Address Register), enter the current date (month/day) in the Date Accepted field of row (b), FR.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '**Always keep the assignment package together**. If a team member cannot complete an interview because, for example, they do not speak the language spoken by the household, do not remove the questionnaire from the assignment package to give a different team member (who speaks the needed language) for completion. You must wait until the original team member completes the remainder of the assignment before moving the assignment, and providing the assignment package, to another team member.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'Follow the steps below to move an AA currently assigned to a team member, to a different team member. If you need to move an AA currently assigned to you to a team member, refer to Topic 3 of this chapter.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# Step 1: Gather Materials Needed' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=101, title='Moving an Assignment from One Team Member to Another', content_len=1732
NEW_TITLE: 'Step 1: Gather Materials Needed'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'You will need the materials listed below. Refer to Topic 1: on page [43](#introduction-2) of this chapter for a description of each item.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Your Field Supervisor Area (FSA) by Assignment Area (AA) map' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Form SC-336, Assignment Directory' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   The AA's assignment package (Address Register + remaining labeled Forms SC-Q, Special Census Questionnaire)' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Form SC-20, Field Supervisor's Management Record' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Form 336.1, Reassignment Worksheet' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Form SC-1019, Employee Listing by FSA' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Black ink ballpoint pen' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# Step 2: Determine which Team Member to Assign to the AA' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=102, title='Step 1: Gather Materials Needed', content_len=521
NEW_TITLE: 'Step 2: Determine which Team Member to Assign to the AA'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'In general, you should try to move the assignment to another team member living near the AA. Be sure to consider any assignments that team member may currently have and their expected completion date.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Locate the AA on your FSA by AA map.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Use the location of each team member's home (annotated on the map) to determine the team member to assign to this AA.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'If the assignment is being moved to another team member because of a language issue:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Use the Form SC-1019, Employee Listing by FSA, to identify a team member speaking the needed language.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
