LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'All assignments you make, including moving an assignment from one team member to another team member, must be reported on the Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If this is the first assignment made this day, in the heading of the form, enter your SCID, FSA number, and the current date in the spaces provided.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   On the first available row of the form:' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (1), enter the number of the AA being assigned.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Leave Column (2) blank.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Column (3), enter the name of the team member previously assigned the AA.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   In Columns (4) and (5), enter the name and employee ID of the team member receiving the assignment.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '```{=html}' -> H1=False
LINE: '<!-- -->' -> H1=False
LINE: '```' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If this is the last assignment being made this day, complete the **Page \_\_\_ of \_\_\_ pages** in the form header.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   Provide the completed form to your manager at your next meeting.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'See Figure 5. Example of Form 336.1, Reassignment Worksheet. on page [59](#_Ref140830354).' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '# Review Remaining Work with the Team Member' -> H1=True
COMMITTED: order=107, title='Step 6: Report the Assignment on Form SC-336.1, Reassignment Worksheet', content_len=974
NEW_TITLE: 'Review Remaining Work with the Team Member'
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'Be sure the team member understands the work needing completed. This may include both canvassing and interviewing work, or interviewing work only.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: 'If the AA is being moved to another team member because of suspected falsification, the entire AA may need to be reworked. Your manager will let you know if the entire AA is to be reworked or if only the uncanvassed areas need worked.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If canvassing needs completed, review with the team member what areas in the AA still need canvassed. Pull out the maps and review them together. Be sure the team member understands which areas have been completed and which have not, as well as how to get to these areas. If you have any notes about the area from reviewing your FSA prior to conducting FR training, discuss them with the team member.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If the team member is only performing interview work, such as attempting to overturn a refusal or completing an interview in a specific language, provide the team member any information you have about the situation from the previous team member. If a Form SC-225, INFO-COMM, is inserted in the questionnaire, review the information on the INFO-COMM with the team member. Remind the team member to keep the INFO-COMM with the questionnaire. Review the maps with the team member, making sure the team member knows how to get to the addresses.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
LINE: '-   If the team member will be conducting an interview at a Spanish-speaking household, be sure to provide them with both the Form SC-Q, Special Census Questionnaire, for that address, as well as a Form SC-Q(S). Remind the FR to first attempt to conduct the interview in English, before using Spanish. After completing the interview using the Form SC-Q(S), the team member is to take the actions indicated in Chapter 3 of their Form SC-1202, Special Census Field Representative Manual. Remind the team member to return both questionnaires, along with the Address Register, to you.' -> H1=False
LINE: '' -> H1=False
